eted representation, value, scope, evidence and gaps |", "| semantic_groups | Stable aspect IDs and explicit condition/effect/exception/timing composition |", "| relations | Typed directed link, applicability, target status, candidates, evidence, requirement grouping |", "| gaps | Missing source, unreadable, unprocessed, ambiguity, conflict or unsupported interpretation; affected targets and blocked operations |", "| profiles | System, edition, rules mode, options, scenario, maps/counters, pinned materials and compatibility decisions |", "| reviews | Exact targets and basis revisions, kind, actor role, decision/observation, scope and supersession |", "| coverage | Inventory revision, region, representation level, status and exclusion reason |", "| snapshots | Selected revisions and hashes, profile, conflicts, manifest and independent readiness reports |", "| runs / evaluation | Raw proposals, context manifest, actual configuration evidence, measurements and independently justified expectations |", "", "`sources.role`: rulebook, errata, faq, scenario, map, counter_sheet, player_aid, other.", "Edition labels do not establish compatibility. Exact transcription, normalization,", "uncertain symbols and interpretation remain distinguishable. Evidence roles are direct,", "context and counterevidence. Attaching a whole page does not prove every assertion.", "", "Nodes include action, event_type, state_variable, resource, timing_window, choice,", "selector, spatial_policy, randomizer, calculation and outcome. Their source representation", "may precede formal execution. A generic payload field alone is not demonstrated support.", "Editorial parentage is not an execution dependency. Clause boundaries preserve complete", "conditions and effects; aspects can be separately reviewed inside a container revision.", "", "## Knowledge and representation", "", "Knowledge states: `known` (evidenced proposal, review separate), `established_absent`", "(source proves absence in an explicit