tory | Coverage denominator |", "| `src/wgc/reconcile/` | Matches, disagreements, omissions, editions | Source IG and explicit gaps |", "| `src/wgc/review/` | Review packets, decisions, freshness | Revision-scoped decision ledger |", "| `src/wgc/semantics/` | Types, expressions, actions, procedure IR | Formal IG linked to source clauses |", "| `src/wgc/reference/` | Simple deterministic execution | Independent comparison baseline |", "| `src/wgc/compiler/` | Type/closure checks and lowering | Reproducible executable package |", "| `src/wgc/runtime/` | Actions, validation, events, replay | State transitions and legal choices |", "| `src/wgc/player/` | Visibility, compact views and deltas | Player-safe decision interface |", "", "These are planned boundaries, not existing implementations. Tests live in corresponding", "`tests/<module>/` directories; public fixtures are synthetic. Source-derived data lives", "in `private/ig/projects/spqr/`. Planning tools in `scripts/` do not implement these modules.", "", "## Existing input evidence", "", "The 2026-10-11 textual inspection recorded 523 rules (438 core, 85 scenario-book),", "233 relations, 48 tables, 134 terms, 79 ambiguities, 3 changes, 59 control questions,", "11 main procedures, 4 subprocedures and 80 steps. These are inventory observations,", "not successful YAML/schema validation or source review. The 27 inspected files were", "hashed. All 36 configured source paths were unavailable at that inspection.", "The private inventory is preserved under `private/ig/planning/wgu-spqr-2026-10-11/`.", "Recheck bytes when implementing; do not turn these counts into hard-coded gold.", "", "An archived 44-page SPQR 5E PDF has been copied, hash-verified, into the active source", "registry `private/ig/sources/spqr-5e/`. Its provenance records the old path and hash.", "Identity with WGU's unavailable original is **unknown**. Explicitly pin it as the source", "of a new IG; reconcile WGU content against it rather than claiming to re